(
F4 T5 / C35 (2026-10-10): post-solve material state pass. Velocity-only
1D stretch (no displacement dof), two bar2, node 1 fixed, node 3 pulled
with velx 1, ONE equilibrium iteration per step, 6 steps of dt 0.01.
The free node 2 must carry velx 0.5 in EVERY step (control_print_history
column), and eptxx = sigxx = 0.03 at the end (= Professional 02-08-2026
and analytic). Old GNU (state of the pre-solve iterate): node 2 velx
0.5, 1, 1, 0.5, 0, 0 over the steps.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_velocity_integrated
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0
node 2 1
node 3 2
element 1 -bar2 1 2
element 2 -bar2 2 3
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx
bounda_time 0 0.
bounda_dof 1 3 -velx
bounda_time 1 1.
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1.
control_timestep 0 0.01 0.06
control_timestep_iterations 0 1
control_print_history 0 -node_dof 2 -velx
target_item 0 -node_dof 2 -velx
target_value 0 0.5 1.e-10
target_item 1 -node_dof 2 -eptxx
target_value 1 0.03 1.e-10
target_item 2 -node_dof 2 -sigxx
target_value 2 0.03 1.e-10
target_item 3 -node_dof 2 -velix
target_value 3 0.03 1.e-10
end_data
